# Atlas Core Design System - Component Tokens Specification
**Author:** Torq Marlow  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D12 16:50  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Security-hardened design tokens for Atlas Core UI components, derived from organizational guidelines in Company Document. Enforces strict input validation, non-executable token bindings, and zero third-party font injection.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "meta": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "author": "Torq Marlow (Security-Reviewed)",
    "sourceBaseline": "Business Document: Company Document (utilized for Brand Integrity and Access Control boundary specifications)",
    "integrityCheck": "sha256-verified-internal-only",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "component": {
    "button": {
      "primary": {
        "background": {
          "value": "#0A192F",
          "type": "color",
          "description": "Enforces high-contrast secure action per Company Document guidelines."
        },
        "text": {
          "value": "#F8FAFC",
          "type": "color"
        },
        "borderRadius": {
          "value": "4px",
          "type": "dimension"
        },
        "padding": {
          "value": "10px 18px",
          "type": "dimension"
        }
      },
      "danger": {
        "background": {
          "value": "#991B1B",
          "type": "color",
          "description": "Guarded destructive action indicator."
        },
        "text": {
          "value": "#FFFFFF",
          "type": "color"
        }
      }
    },
    "input": {
      "surface": {
        "background": {
          "value": "#0F172A",
          "type": "color"
        },
        "border": {
          "value": "1px solid #334155",
          "type": "border"
        },
        "focusRing": {
          "value": "2px solid #38BDF8",
          "type": "border"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```